{"type":"message","id":"715615ef","parentId":"594c3c80","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:03:39.333Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All auth attempts are failing. Let me try a few more things:\n\n1. Maybe the key name is different - like `api_key` in header\n2. Maybe the endpoint for POST is different\n\nActually wait - the `/history` endpoint works fine with `X-API-Key` header, but the POST `/send` doesn't. This suggests the POST might need different auth. Let me try with the same X-API-Key header approach for POST.\n\nWait, I DID use X-API-Key for GET and it worked! But I used X-API-Key for POST and got 1101 (not Unauthorized). So maybe X-API-Key works for POST too, but 1101 is a different error - maybe a parameter validation error?\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\nGET 用 `X-API-Key` 成功，POST 返回 1101（不是 Unauthorized）。让我换回 `X-API-Key` 并尝试不同的 payload 结构：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-d851226d-ed58-4b0e-8eac-ce9d8ffc5c42","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-a43d594e-ef1e-433c-b5b8-57bfb21833c6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21335,"output":360,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21807,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778990597870,"responseId":"chatcmpl-953fa3dc-3099-4ff0-90c0-35bcdf559b37"}}
