{"type":"message","id":"286bf1f1","parentId":"b060ef41","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:03:52.380Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So with X-API-Key header on POST, I get 1101 error (not auth error). With Bearer, I get Unauthorized. The 1101 error is consistent and different from the 401 Unauthorized that Bearer gives. So X-API-Key at least authenticates for POST, but something about the request is wrong.\n\nLet me check if the endpoint exists and what it expects. Maybe I need to send data differently - maybe as form data or with a different content type. Or maybe the `echoAsset` field is causing issues, or maybe I need `type` field, or `target` field.\n\nActually, let me look at what the history messages show - they have `type: \"message\"`. Maybe I need to include that.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n`X-API-Key` POST 认证通过（不是 Unauthorized），但返回 1101（请求格式问题）。让我检查 endpoint 并尝试修复请求体：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-b5278ebe-abce-47a0-90e6-68d15d3246ad","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/\" -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | head -200"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-458ce6f9-b56d-42d8-9d88-4a9953adb2a1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with type and replyTo fields\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"type\":\"message\",\"content\":\"test\",\"replyTo\":null}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1486,"output":350,"cacheRead":20352,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22188,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778990619665,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a1038b3a-13ab-4e40-b232-aaaa59bd72c1"}}
