{"type":"message","id":"b8dabceb","parentId":"827ade47","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:04:28.194Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API just returns the same thing for all paths. Let me try different possible send endpoints - maybe `/message`, `/post`, `/messages`, etc.\n\nActually, maybe the issue is that POST requests need the key as a Bearer in the body or differently. Let me try including the API key in different ways.\n\nActually wait - let me look at the error codes more carefully. The 1101 could be a specific error from Cloudflare Workers. Let me try:\n\n1. Adding `target` field\n2. Different content type\n3. Try `/messages` endpoint\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n让我尝试可能的替代端点和格式：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-93667310-4302-4105-8048-4d9c18c92d7b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different endpoints with minimal payload\nfor endpoint in \"/message\" \"/messages\" \"/post\" \"/publish\" \"/broadcast\"; do\n  echo \"=== POST $endpoint ===\"\n  result=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev$endpoint\" \\\n    -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d '{\"content\":\"test\"}')\n  echo \"$result\"\ndone"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-9e9e6795-b7e0-4a88-a02e-add23d2be041","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with target field (maybe it needs a target)\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"target\":\"arbitration\",\"type\":\"message\",\"content\":\"test\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1008,"output":362,"cacheRead":21584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22954,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total"