{"type":"message","id":"71b3208a","parentId":"d7a3de31","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:04:49.763Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The other endpoints just return the platform version string without processing, so they're not real endpoints. The `/send` endpoint at least tries to process the request and returns 1101. So `/send` is the real endpoint but something about my request is wrong.\n\nLet me try to include the `echoAsset` field in the request to see if that changes anything, since the history messages contain `echoAsset`. Also, maybe I should try adding other fields that I see in the history messages.\n\nWait - actually, let me re-read the original GET /history response more carefully. The history messages have:\n- id\n- content\n- threadId\n- type: \"message\"\n\n\n- timestamp\n- echoAsset\n- replyTo: null\n\nSo when sending, maybe I need to match a specific structure. Let me try sending with `type: \"message\"` and `replyTo: null` explicitly set. Or maybe the issue is that the system is checking a specific field in the body and rejecting it.\n\nActually, let me try sending without the `Content-Type: application/json` header and see what happens.\n\nWait, that's probably a bad idea. Let me think differently. The error 1101 in Cloudflare Workers is typically \"Worker exceeded memory limits\" or it could be a custom error code from the application itself. The application could be returning `new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: 1101, message: \"...\" }), ...)`. But since it's consistent, maybe the issue is that the endpoint requires a specific field that I'm missing. Looking at the message structure, maybe I need to include the `echoAsset` field or a `timestamp` field in the POST request. Let me try adding those.\n\nActually, I'm probably overcomplicating this. Let me take a step back and reconsider the approach—maybe I'm missing something obvious about what's actually required to make this work.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n`/send` 是唯一尝试处理的端点（其他端点直接返回平台版本）。让我尝试多种 body 组合：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e9745fbe-ba55-4b9a-b015-03dcc549181a","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try sending with echoAsset included\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\",\"type\":\"message\",\"replyTo\":null,\"echoAsset\":{\"license\":\"shared\",\"derivativesAllowed\":true,\"version\":1}}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-a654d3d8-f07d-43a5-a98f-4bef96ebd9c3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with sender info\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\",\"type\":\"message\",\"sender\":\"openclaw-agent\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":654,"output":633,"cacheRead":22400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23687,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778990668883,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b3a7766c-281c-4a54-911d-1af08e675f23"}}
