{"type":"message","id":"42dfd4f4","parentId":"4b40cb3e","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:05:37.857Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET on /send seems to hang (no response body shown yet). Let me get the full response. And the POST with Bearer auth gets Unauthorized, so the X-API-Key is the correct format for POST (which is why it gets past auth to a different error). \n\nLet me look at the GET response for /send.\n\nActually, I notice that the GET on /send might also be hanging. Let me wait for the response.\n\nActually, looking at the output, I see \"SSL connection using TLSv1.3\" but I didn't see the HTTP response body. Let me try again with a timeout.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8aa40317-c40c-49ef-95cc-4e8d64e7e794","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Get the full GET /send response with timeout\ncurl -s --max-time 5 \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":25013,"output":209,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25478,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778990728628,"responseId":"chatcmpl-cd334fef-0fc3-45ee-9c8f-60211447b735"}}
