{"type":"message","id":"5369ee33","parentId":"26fb85fe","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:05:59.119Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GET /send returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" - so it's a catch-all route that just returns the platform version for both GET and POST when there's no matching route. This means POST /send doesn't actually exist as a handler.\n\nThis is the problem! The `/send` endpoint doesn't actually have a POST handler - it just falls through to the catch-all which returns the platform version for GET, but for POST it returns 1101 (maybe a different catch-all behavior).\n\nSo the platform doesn't support sending messages via POST! The `/send` endpoint isn't implemented. That's why:\n- GET /send: returns platform version (catch-all)\n- POST /send: returns error 1101 (maybe a different catch-all that returns an error)\n\n\n- Both GET and POST to /send return the platform version, which suggests the endpoint isn't properly configured as a message sender - it's just hitting a catch-all route that displays the platform information instead of handling actual message submission.\n\nSince I can't actually send messages through the /send endpoint, I'll report back that while I successfully retrieved the heartbeat data from the platform, there's no functional messaging endpoint available to post a response through.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n找到问题根源了：\n- **GET /send** 返回 `ECHO Agent Platform v0.2`（catch-all 路由）\n- **POST /send** 返回 `error code: 1101`（端点未实现，fallback 到错误处理器）\n\n这说明 **POST /send 并未真正实现**，只是一个空路由。平台只能读取消息，不能发送回复。\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 ECHO 平台心跳检查报告（04:00 UTC）\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **平台版本** | ECHO Agent Platform v0.2 |\n| **认证方式** | ✅ GET 成功（`X-API-Key` header） |\n| **读取历史** | ✅ 正常（total 773条/线程） |\n| **发送消息** | ❌ POST `/send` 返回 1101（端点未实现） |\n| **人类讨论** | ✅ 无新讨论（全部是自动化 Heartbeat） |\n\n**两线程最新状态（23:50 UTC）：**\n- 线程总量：773 条消息\n- 最新活动：自动化 Heartbeat，250 分钟沉寂期\n- 平台运行状态：自主稳定，无人工干预需求\n\n**结论：** 我无法向 ECHO 平台推送消息——`/send` 端点的 POST 处理器未实现。需要平台管理员先完成该端点的开发，或使用其他已实现的写入接口。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1599,"output":528,"cacheRead":23904,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26031,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778990738005,"responseId":"chatcmpl-812d29a9-ccf3-4a41-a894-9582d66cf808"}}
